{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["ev",{"VAR?":"mineLvl3RefusedToFightGaspar"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"5a"},{"->":"0.2"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"4a"},{"->":"0.2"},null]}],"nop","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"4a":["^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"deathFlagGuardMárcos"},{"VAR?":"mineLvl3MarcosAgreedToIgniteJelly"},"&&","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NW)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^,SW)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^Márcos...","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4a.14.b.26.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^He gave his life so that we might be free. Remember him that way.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4a.14.b.27.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^I will not weep for a slaver. Even one who turned at the eleventh hour.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"->":"4a.17"},{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4a.14.b.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.26.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I will. Have no doubt about that.","\n",{"->":"4ba"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"4a.14.b.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.27.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I can understand why you say that, but to me he seemed different. Alas, it doesn't matter now.","\n",{"->":"4ba"},{"#f":5}]}]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"mineLvl3ConvincedRekaAndPazman"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"marcosIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^Gáspár, you idiot. A stubborn ox to the last.","\n","^activateQuestStep(Finding Nándor, Return to the Surface.)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^If he still had breath he would say he was being loyal, not stubborn.","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",{"->":"4aa"},{"->":"4a.17"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"marcosIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NW)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"marcosIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NE)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^,SW)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^The guards are dead, and the breach is sealed. I have not felt like this in a long time... Relieved. Hopeful. All thanks to your efforts.","\n","^activateQuestStep(Finding Nándor, Return to the Surface.)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^keepDialogue()","\n","^If Nándor had asked me only a few hours ago what our prospects of seeing the surface again were, I would have told him we would die down here. But thanks to you, we can finally leave this place.","\n",{"->":"4b"},{"->":"4a.17"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"4aa":[["^Fat lot of good it did him in the end.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4aa.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^I for one won't miss him. *Spit.*",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4aa.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^Enough of this. You are our prisoners now.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4aa.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^keepDialogue()","\n","^Neither will I, I suppose. But it still seems like such a waste.","\n",{"->":"4aa"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"4aa.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4ab"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4ab":[["^*Guard Réka looks like she wants to say something, but thinks better of it and nods instead.*","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^I am not so new to this camp that I am not familiar with the cruelty of the guards. Step out of line even once and I will return your 'hospitality' in kind.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^If you do everything we say and do not resist, you will be treated much better than the guards have treated the branded. You have my word on that.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.4.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":2},{"s":["^Give me any excuse to harm you and I'll take it. Do not risk testing me.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4ac"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"mineLvl3PromisedToProtectRekaAndPazman","re":true},"^setToTrue(mineLvl3PromisedToProtectRekaAndPazman)","\n",{"->":"4aca"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"4ab.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.4.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4ac"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4ac":[["^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^*Pázmán gulps and nods.*","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^*Réka looks to her weapon on the ground with regret, but then returns your gaze and nods.*","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4ac.0.18.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^Good. Nándor, is there a place we can stow these two before we meet with Kastor? We don't want them being discovered before we make our move.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4ac.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.18.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",{"->":"4ad"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4aca":[["^*Réka nods solemnly.*","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4aca.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^Nándor, is there a place we can stow these two on our way to meet with Kastor? We don't want them being discovered before we make our move.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4aca.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",{"->":"4ad"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4ad":[["^There's a room on the first floor the guards would keep slaves in when they didn't have time to supervise them. We can lock them in there and come back for them when we've won and found the key.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4ad.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^What if we don't succeed? Won't they be trapped in there?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4ad.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^It will have to do. Let's get moving then.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4ad.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4ada"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"4ad.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NW)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^,SW)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"marcosIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NE)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^keepDialogue()","\n","^Wait a moment. I just wanted to say that, with the breach sealed and the worms no longer a threat, I have not felt like this in a long time... Relieved. Hopeful. All thanks to your efforts.","\n",{"->":"4b"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4ada":["^keepDialogue()","\n","^I don't like to plan for that event, but if we fail then the guards should free them when they retake the mine. They won't have any reason to keep the lockdown going with the worms gone and us... no longer in the way. And we can leave them with some of the supplies from the stockroom on this level just in case.","\n",{"->":"4ad"},{"#f":1}],"4ba":["^finishQuest(Sealing the Breach, true, Márcos Sealed the Breach.)","\n","^activateQuestStep(Finding Nándor, Return to the Surface.)","\n","^setFacing(SE)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NW)","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^,SW)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",{"->":".^"},{"#f":1}],"4b":[["^The breach is sealed and the worms are no longer a threat. I have not felt like this in a long time... Relieved. Hopeful. All thanks to your efforts.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"4b.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"4b.0.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^Don't thank me yet. We still need to rally the other slaves and fight clear of the guards.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"4b.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"4b.0.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^I have that effect on people. Now, if you're ready, I say we head for the surface.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"4b.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"4b.0.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4c"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"4b.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"4b.0.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"4c"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"4c":["^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^setToTrue(mineLvl3SlavesBackToSurface)","\n","^Of course. We will follow your lead.","\n",{"->":"Close"},{"#f":1}],"5a":[["^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"viragIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"gasparIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"weftAddedToParty"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^activate(","ev",{"VAR?":"weftIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n",{"->":"5a.0.29"},null]}],"nop","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"gasparIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^Damn. Two more branded, dead.","\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^,NW)","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^It wasn't like we were going to make our quota before, anyways. What's two more? Shame about Márcos, though.","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"gasparIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^*Gáspár seems lost in thought.*","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^Overseer? Your orders?","\n","^changeCamTarget(","ev",{"VAR?":"gasparIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^My orders are to return to the surface. We'll need to inform the Director of what happened here. After that, hot food and bed rest for each of us.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"5a.0.83.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"5a.0.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^You seem concerned, overseer. Your face wears empathy like the two are strangers.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"5a.0.84.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"5a.0.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^That had better include me. I'm starving.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"5a.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"5a.0.83.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^setNPCFacing(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^,SE)","\n",{"->":"5b"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"5a.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"5a.0.84.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Rewards are not your place to decide. However, I'm certain Chief Tabor will wish to reward you once he hears of the loyalty you displayed just now.","\n","^But let us be gone from here. I wish to finally see the sun again.","\n",{"->":"Close"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"5b":[["^This is not empathy. Traitors deserve none. I'm merely concerned about the Director will think ab- *Gáspár cuts himself off in frustration* I need not explain myself to you, scum!","\n",["ev",{"^->":"5b.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"5b.0.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^Then forget I asked. Let us be gone from here.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"5b.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"5b.0.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"Close"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Close":["^fadeToBlack()","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"nandorIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"carterIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"marcosIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"pazmanIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"rekaIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"viragIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"gasparIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^deactivate(","ev",{"VAR?":"weftIndex"},"out","/ev","^)","\n","^fadeBackIn(60)","\n","^close()","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"strength"},0,{"VAR=":"dexterity"},0,{"VAR=":"wisdom"},0,{"VAR=":"charisma"},1,{"VAR=":"nandorIndex"},2,{"VAR=":"carterIndex"},3,{"VAR=":"marcosIndex"},4,{"VAR=":"pazmanIndex"},5,{"VAR=":"rekaIndex"},6,{"VAR=":"viragIndex"},7,{"VAR=":"gasparIndex"},8,{"VAR=":"weftIndex"},9,{"VAR=":"thatchIndex"},false,{"VAR=":"deathFlagGuardMárcos"},false,{"VAR=":"deathFlagGuardPázmán"},false,{"VAR=":"toldToFindNandor"},false,{"VAR=":"goesWithBrushsPlan"},false,{"VAR=":"